<<Draw mirror 1.0 0.35>>
Wizard: Some Absolute donkeh enchanted the mirror with one ancient curse called "Windows 11"... 
Wizard: But no problem, no problem.
Wizard: Mirror now runing latest Mirror 7 IOS. Fully runescribed and aether bound, everything proper proper.
Wizard: Now it has custom background support also. I put this cute puppy fo' now also.
Wizard: It Scrype calls, and what the young mages arre call the "Vine".
Wizard: Which is, how you people saying... Magical network of... flying pigs?

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I do not wish to Scrype anyone. Throw a sheet over it, it's destracting the princess in her royal duties!
<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: Too late saar. Call incoming from... “The Blue Brigade”?
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: [normalWave]Decline! Where is the button? Where is the button?![/normalWave]

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
<<Hide mirror>>
Brigada: [normalWave]ZORAN![/normalWave]
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: ...
<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Do you know how long I have been trying to call you? I had to listen to lute music for three days!
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: You are breaking up. [normalWave]KRRRK[/normalWave]. I cannot hear you. [normalWave]KRRRK[/normalWave].
<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: Saar, connection is <color=cyan>crystal</color> clear. <color=cyan>crystal</color> clear only.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Not now, you insolent buffoon!

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: You left without a word, Zoran! I sent fourteen ravens! They all came back! One even had a broken wing!
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk  0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Ah, that! A misunderstanding. I assumed they were carriers for bad news, so I ignored them. A wise man picks his ravens.
Zoran: You look well. Are those new horns? Very slimming.

Brigada: [normalWave]THOSE ARENT HORNS, THATS MY ROYAL CROWN YOU...! YOU![/normalWave]
Brigada: And another thing! Some little army attacked my outriders near the border! They came from YOUR direction, Zoran!

<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Whaa? My direction? No, no, that was... The... One of my rats! Very pale. Her name is Gertrude.
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: A rat attacked my soldiers..?
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Very territorial...

<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: I don't care if it's a rat, a goblin, or a goat wearing a crown! If someone attacks my people, they answer to me!
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: And if that someone is hiding behind YOUR walls, then I'm coming to get them!
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: That seems hasty. Have you considered... 
Zoran: Idk...
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Not doing that?
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: [normalWave]I'm done playing these games![/normalWave] I'm bringing the army, I'm bringing our son, and I'm enforcing the Royal Decree!
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: That decree is invalid! You... You can't inforce it...

<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: Saar, the late <color=orange>King Cefan Susni</color> ratified your marriage. 
Wizard: I have the royal decree right here.
Wizard: Please see, official document. Very official.
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Put that down! It is not a decree! It is a napkin with a donkey drawn on it!
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: That donkey is the Royal Seal of Love! <3 The late king himself drew a little crown on it and wrote: <br>"Zoran + Brigada 4ever".
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: It was written in crayon. It has a smiley face. It is legally worthless.
<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: The late king did love crayon. His final will had a dapper crayon unicorn.


<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: I am coming to your little tower, Zoran! And when I get there, I'm going to drag you back to the Blue Marches by your skinny, lying neck!
Brigada: And if <color=green>anyone</color> tries to stop me, I'll bury them in a sea of holy salt!
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: [smoothWave]The line is breaking. Goodbye.[/smoothWave]

